## Model providers

Chat and embedding requests are sent to whichever OpenAI-compatible endpoint you
configure (OpenRouter by default). You are responsible for complying with that
provider's terms, and for the data-handling implications of sending your users'
content to it. Free model tiers frequently permit prompt logging and training on
submitted data — check before pointing a paying customer's traffic at one.
